flowchart TD
    Start([User Input]) --> Receive[Receive & Parse Request]
    Receive --> Hist[Load Session History]
    
    Hist --> Classify{Classify Intent<br/>(LLM Key 2)}
    
    Classify -->|Direct Chat| ContextOnly
    Classify -->|Complex Query| RetrievalStart
    
    subgraph "Retrieval Pipeline"
        RetrievalStart((Start)) --> ParExtract[Extract Entities<br/>(LLM Key 3)]
        RetrievalStart --> ParVector[Vector Search<br/>(ChromaDB)]
        
        ParExtract --> GraphQuery[Graph Traversal<br/>(NetworkX)]
        
        GraphQuery --> Fusion[Fusion Layer Input]
        ParVector --> Fusion
        
        Fusion --> Rank[Calculate Scores:<br/>Sem + Struct + Recency]
        Rank --> TopK[Select Top K Context]
    end
    
    ContextOnly --> BuildPrompt
    TopK --> BuildPrompt[Construct System Prompt<br/>with Retrieved Context]
    
    BuildPrompt --> Generate[Generate Response<br/>(LLM Key 1)]
    
    Generate --> Display[Return JSON to Client]
    
    Display --> AsyncStart((Async))
    
    subgraph "Knowledge Update"
        AsyncStart --> SaveSQL[Save to SQLite DB]
        AsyncStart --> ExtractResp[Extract Entities from Response<br/>(LLM Key 4)]
        
        ExtractResp --> UpdateGraph[Update Graph Nodes & Edges]
        UpdateGraph --> SaveGraph[Persist Graph State]
    end
    
    SaveSQL --> End([End])
    SaveGraph --> End
